      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEATLEY HAYZE (3) is building a very strong record, the latest jumping favourite and scoring an all the way win (19.08) at this track in Grade 5 over 350m. Brilliant beginner who should be leading the way here. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. APRICOT SLICE (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.7 lengths at Cambridge Raceway in a handy 21.53 beating Love It. Can measure up again. WALLY'S BOY (8) has mixed form recently, finishing fifth (17.05) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Well placed here and can atone this time. SON OF BOB (1) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
